    how=("Energy is the budget", "A node's radio uses far more energy than its sensor or processor, and listening costs about as much as transmitting. Nodes therefore keep the radio off almost all the time, a practice called **duty cycling**, and wake briefly to exchange data. Protocols are judged by how many years they let a battery last."),
